## Files

- `tool/cop_catalog.py`: loads the inventory; every check lives here.
- `tool/cop_graph.py`: IR (nodes, inputs, parameters, tags), validation, save and load.
- `tool/hou_compile.py`: IR to real COP nodes (hython), read-back, export, hip.
- `tool/window_height.py`: the window height as IR; `DEFAULTS` are the values reached by SimpleHeight L05.
- `tool/evaluate.py`: measures one PNG against the reference (python3 with numpy).
- `tool/optimize_window.py`, `tool/watchdog.sh`: the search and its keep-alive.
- `tool/build_docs.py`, `docs/cop/`: one page per Copernicus node (exact parameters + web summary).
- `inventory/`: `cop_inventory.json` (all nodes, all parameters), `cop_names.txt`.
- `JOURNAL.md`: append-only digest of the conversations that built this skill.
- `REVIEW.md`: premortem and review checklist for the morning review.

